---
import { site } from '../data/site'
---
<section class="border-t border-ink-100 py-20 sm:py-28 dark:border-ink-800">
  <div class="container-page" data-rise>
    <h2 class="max-w-2xl text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink-900 sm:text-4xl dark:text-white">
      Give it one repository and see what comes back.
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-lg text-ink-600 dark:text-ink-400">
      Twenty runs a month, free, with the same permissions and the same
      transcripts as every other plan.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
      <a href="/pricing" class="rounded-lg bg-ink-900 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-ink-800 dark:bg-white dark:text-ink-900 dark:hover:bg-ink-100">Start free</a>
      <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="rounded-lg border border-ink-200 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-ink-800 transition-colors hover:bg-ink-50 dark:border-ink-700 dark:text-ink-200 dark:hover:bg-ink-900">Ask a question</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
